      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CORMORAN STRIKE NZ (12) broke when tackling the Bill Collins Sprint at Melton last start but is much better suited returning to this venue having put together a string of top-two results here prior. Draws out but he is building a strong record at the mile and is good enough to overcome the barrier. TORO STRIDE NZ (4) is another coming through the Bill Collins Sprint where he copped a tough barrier. Good effort to place when resuming from a wide barrier here prior and ended his last campaign with a placing in the Inter Dominion Final. Has a class drop and a better draw in his favour. ZENITH STRIDE (9) scored by 3m over this distance last start, his second success from four starts here since a long layoff. Both of those wins were from this barrier. Each way hope. YOUR MAJESTY (6) is a two-time fresh winner readied with a solid trial. Expect a strong return from her.",
